<title>SINGAPORE: FJ Benjamin gets new distribution rights.</title>
<headline>FJ Benjamin gets new distribution rights.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>High fashion retailer F J Benjamin Holdings Ltd said on Monday it had obtained regional distribution rights to Isaac Mizrahi, an American brand.</p>
<p>No further details were given in the company statement.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
